{"parse": {"title": "犹在镜中-05", "pageid": 56477, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8A%B9%E5%9C%A8%E9%95%9C%E4%B8%AD-04\" title=\"犹在镜中-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">犹在镜中-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%8A%B9%E5%9C%A8%E9%95%9C%E4%B8%AD-06\" title=\"犹在镜中-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">犹在镜中</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.8E.A9.E8.80.8D.E6.97.B6.E9.97.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"玩耍时间\">玩耍时间</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 玩耍时间</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Good Time</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1960305</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_jingzizhenliao3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>它能映出您“内心的图景”。您可以把它当作一个心理手术用的“内视镜”。我使用了一点神秘术来便于自由联想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-308001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>您只需要看一下它，然后告诉我眼前所见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-308012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-308012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-308012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我看过吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-308012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-308012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-308012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>那枚手镜……在它破碎之前——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-308011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-308011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-308011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我用它观照过自我吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>……这东西是从哪儿来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>上面没有篆刻，没有铭纹，外框的着色也太过轻浮和妖艳。这不是一枚适合淑女的手镜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>就算镜面尚且算光洁，也不能改变它只是一个残次品的事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>克拉拉·温格勒，你不能用这样的镜子作为你的第一枚手镜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我既不寻求你的承认，也不询问你的意见，父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我只是来告诉你，我有第一枚手镜了。所以不需要等到你承认的那天再施舍给我一枚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>就是这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>不，等等——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>父亲，这是克拉拉的朋友给她的礼物，是一个祝福，我想这对她来说比什么都重要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>还有你，克拉拉——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>她的朋友？她的什么朋友？那些该死的吉普赛人？还是那些在下水道里像老鼠一样四处逃逸的神秘学商贩？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>不管是哪个——当她把这东西拿进温格勒家的这一刻起，就是对我的羞辱！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>“作为你的第一枚手镜”？不要再说这么可笑的话了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>这甚至不能被称为镜子，而是对温格勒姓氏完完全全的玷污。我告诉过你，不要再试图把任何劣质品带到我面前来，妄想取得我的承认——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>就像你的那些“朋友”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>父亲！您这话说得有些太重了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>阿尔伯德，和你的约定我已经完成了。我给他看了，从此以后，这就是我的镜子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>克拉拉，等等我，你先别走——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>不管她要去哪儿，都不能带着那东西走。它的归宿只能是回到熔炉里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>把那个残次品从她手里拿过来，阿尔伯德！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>父亲，让克拉拉留下它吧，您再找一枚其他的手镜，作为第一枚手镜送给她，这样好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>她也并非有意要让您为难，您知道的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>除了她的“事业”和被她视为“理想”的幻想，她对现实的一切都不闻不问，如何不会使我为难！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>只要她还像这样无耻度日的每一天，那都是对我的为难和羞辱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>父亲——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>“老鼠一样的神秘学商贩”？看来您真是完全忘记自己的发家史了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>如果温格勒这个姓氏真的像您自以为的那样体面，那为何您和您送出的请柬始终只能徘徊在那些上流者的门外？他们难道听不见您的声音，望不见您对融入的向往？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>您恨不能撕下所有属于神秘学商贩的过往皮囊，再换上旁人的血液，好成为一个全新的、得体的、好的……“人”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>至少不能是神秘学家，不能是“老鼠”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>你——你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我说错了吗？我只是……陈述事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>当您急切地想要与非理性和疯狂撇清关系时，却反而陷入了泥沼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>您责难母亲仍与旧友保持联系是一种不合时宜，您对他们的状况一无所知也不想了解。但您以为的那些真正的朋友，究竟有没有站在过您身旁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>说真的，我怜悯您。至少我拥有诚挚的友谊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>——克拉拉·温格勒！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>你又做过了什么？！退学、翻进有夫之妇的院墙、卖弄神秘术把戏、组织非法结社……我看你早就疯了，才会这样羞辱和顶撞你的父亲——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>但是——但是你说对了一件事。更应该被送进精神病院的，的确不是你那些病人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>而是你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>父亲！如果您非要这样说，就没有任何挽回的余地了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"514101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"514101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/47/HeadIconSmall-514101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-514101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">中年男人：</div><div>动手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>克拉拉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听从指令的佣人们阻塞在通往前廊、通往门口的唯一道路上，仿佛沉默的雕塑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不交出手镜，她无法走出这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>不用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我自己来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手镜当然一直被紧握在手里。只是此刻那手被高高地抬起，进而猛地坠下——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它摔出去，坚硬与坚硬更亲密地相碰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-517402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔伯德：</div><div>……克拉拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>四分五裂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308018.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-308018.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308018.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308018.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-308018.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308018.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9f/HeadIconSmall-308018.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308018.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>父亲，这将是我最后一次如您所愿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>是啊，它碎了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我又要如何用它来观照自我呢？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_kongfangjian\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_kongfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……我应该没有用镜子真正地“看”过自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>就像那面在“暴雨”里碎裂的台镜一样，手镜也碎了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡卡尼亚轻轻地微笑起来，而后又戛然而止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她令自己再度沉入维也纳的雨幕，在幻觉中看到话语里那面碎裂的台镜。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_suijingzi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_suijingzi\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_suijingzi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-1_9_at_suijingzi.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_suijingzi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-1_9_at_suijingzi.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_suijingzi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-1_9_at_suijingzi.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_suijingzi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>太多破碎了，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>我又要怎么去看呢？那就不再想着这件事了吧。那时候，我认为这无关紧要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>因为总是有那么多更要紧的事在等待着我！多么自负，多么天真，却没有看见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>整个社会都是一地碎片，并且碎片还会继续破碎，分裂出更多的碎片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>任何人，凭借一己之力，是无法将它们整合起来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>所以我必须去呼唤……我必须去告知人们，号召他们，将目光转向这最紧要的事情，正视这迫在眉睫的顽疾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……而最后，我只是让破碎提前发生了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>为何活下来的偏偏是我呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">心理医生：</div><div>你的说法有其道理。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">心理医生：</div><div>但我认为，你之所以坚持说出这样的话，只是因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">心理医生：</div><div>你仍然在责备自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……那我又能怎样呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>难道我要对自己苟活下来的耻辱视而不见吗？难道我要对自己的罪恶视若罔闻……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>假如我这样轻松地得以幸存，那被“暴雨”冲刷、被“回溯”、化为碎片的人，那些心怀希望，仍想在这世上生存下去的人……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>他们又因何而死？他们的逝去……又有什么意义？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_kongfangjian\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_kongfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_kongfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">心理医生：</div><div>所以你将目光从身上移开了，从你自己破碎的镜面上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">心理医生：</div><div>但移开目光之后，你也并没有得到答案，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡卡尼亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她低下了头，为这桩无可掩盖的罪证和事实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">心理医生：</div><div>……无论如何，请至少尝试一下吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"517501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"517501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/HeadIconSmall-517501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-517501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">心理医生：</div><div>从你的镜子里看看自己。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "犹在镜中-05"}}